{"seq":3,"slug":"delaunay-voronoi","title":"Delaunay 与 Voronoi：一枚硬币的两面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/convex-triangulation/delaunay-voronoi","wordCount":1820,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"delaunay-与-voronoi-一枚硬币的两面\">Delaunay 与 Voronoi：一枚硬币的两面</h1><p>在一片平原上散布着若干消防站，把整片区域按「离哪个消防站最近」染色，你会得到一张由多边形拼成的地图——这就是 Voronoi 图。现在把每两个共享边界的相邻站点连起来，得到的三角网就是 Delaunay 三角剖分。这两个结构是同一枚硬币的正反面（互为对偶），它们同时是计算几何里最优美、应用最广的构造：最近邻查询、网格生成、地形插值、聚类、路径规划都以它们为基石。本节讲清这对结构的定义、性质、构造算法与彼此的对偶关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>给定平面上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个站点（site），每个站点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 Voronoi 单元是「平面上离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 比离任何其他站点都近」的点的集合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(p_i) = \\{ x : \\|x - p_i\\| \\le \\|x - p_j\\|,\\ \\forall j \\ne i \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个单元都是凸多边形（可能无界），所有单元拼成整个平面，这就是 Voronoi 图。它的对偶 Delaunay 三角剖分则连接「Voronoi 单元相邻」的站点对，得到一个覆盖点集凸包的三角网。二者的核心桥梁是「空圆性质」：一个三角形属于 Delaunay 三角剖分，当且仅当它的外接圆内部不含任何其他站点——判断这一点靠的正是第一章的「点在圆内」谓词，见 <a href=\"../foundations/geometric-primitives\">几何图元与谓词</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[n 个站点] --&gt; V[Voronoi 图&lt;br/&gt;按最近站点划分平面]&#10;  P --&gt; D[Delaunay 三角剖分&lt;br/&gt;空外接圆三角网]&#10;  V &lt;--&gt;|对偶| D&#10;  D --&gt; M1[增量翻边法 O n log n 期望]&#10;  D --&gt; M2[Fortune 扫描线 O n log n]&#10;  D --&gt; M3[分治法 O n log n]&#10;  D --&gt; A1[最大化最小角&lt;br/&gt;避免瘦三角形]&#10;  V --&gt; A2[最近邻/最近点对]&#10;  D --&gt; A3[网格生成/插值]\">graph TD\n  P[n 个站点] --&gt; V[Voronoi 图&lt;br/&gt;按最近站点划分平面]\n  P --&gt; D[Delaunay 三角剖分&lt;br/&gt;空外接圆三角网]\n  V &lt;--&gt;|对偶| D\n  D --&gt; M1[增量翻边法 O n log n 期望]\n  D --&gt; M2[Fortune 扫描线 O n log n]\n  D --&gt; M3[分治法 O n log n]\n  D --&gt; A1[最大化最小角&lt;br/&gt;避免瘦三角形]\n  V --&gt; A2[最近邻/最近点对]\n  D --&gt; A3[网格生成/插值]</pre><p>下表对比这对结构的性质与用途。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Voronoi 图</th>\n<th>Delaunay 三角剖分</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本对象</td>\n<td>区域（凸多边形单元）</td>\n<td>三角形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顶点含义</td>\n<td>三个站点的等距点（外心）</td>\n<td>站点本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 站点）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>至多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3n-6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定谓词</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>空外接圆（点在圆内）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>最近邻分区、覆盖分析</td>\n<td>网格生成、插值、避瘦三角</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"对偶-为什么两者本质相同\">对偶：为什么两者本质相同</h2><p>Voronoi 图与 Delaunay 三角剖分互为对偶，意思是二者携带完全相同的信息，只是几何呈现不同。具体对应关系是：Delaunay 三角剖分中的每个站点（顶点）对应 Voronoi 图中的一个单元（面）；每条 Delaunay 边对应一条 Voronoi 边（两者垂直平分）；每个 Delaunay 三角形对应一个 Voronoi 顶点（该三角形的外心，也就是三个站点的公共等距点）。</p>\n<p>这种对偶不只是理论对称，它有实用价值：算出其中一个，就能在线性时间里推出另一个。工程上常常构造更规整的 Delaunay 三角剖分（都是三角形，数据结构统一），再对偶出 Voronoi 图。对偶关系还解释了为什么 Voronoi 顶点是三个站点的外心——因为它是对应 Delaunay 三角形空外接圆的圆心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空圆性质与-delaunay-的优良品质\">空圆性质与 Delaunay 的优良品质</h2><p>Delaunay 三角剖分之所以是「最好的」点集三角剖分，源于它的空圆性质及其推论。核心定理：在所有可能的三角剖分中，Delaunay 三角剖分最大化了最小内角——也就是说，它尽量避免又瘦又长的三角形。这对数值应用极其重要：有限元分析、地形插值中，瘦长三角形会放大数值误差、降低插值质量，而 Delaunay 给出角度分布最健康的网格。</p>\n<p>空圆性质还带来一个局部可检验的判据。给定两个共享一条边的相邻三角形构成的四边形，如果其中一个三角形的外接圆包含了对面的第四个顶点，那么这条对角线是「非法」的，把它翻转到四边形的另一条对角线，就能改善（这叫边翻转/edge flip）。反复翻转所有非法边直到没有为止，就得到 Delaunay 三角剖分——这是 Lawson 翻边算法的基础。判断「外接圆是否含第四点」正是点在圆内谓词，它的度数是 4，比转向测试更易受浮点误差影响，因此 Delaunay 构造对鲁棒性尤其敏感，见 <a href=\"../foundations/robustness-degeneracy\">鲁棒性与退化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种构造算法\">三种构造算法</h2><p>第一种是增量翻边法（incremental with flips）。逐个插入站点：每插入一个新点，找到包含它的三角形并把它一分为三，然后对受影响的边做 Lawson 翻转恢复 Delaunay 性质。配合随机化插入顺序，期望复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。它实现相对直观，是许多库的默认，且天然支持增量更新。</p>\n<p>第二种是 Fortune 扫描线算法（1987），把上一节和线段相交里反复出现的扫描线范式用到极致，见 <a href=\"../queries/line-intersection\">线段相交</a>。一条水平线从上往下扫过所有站点，维护一条由抛物线弧组成的「海岸线」（beach line），在站点事件与圆事件处更新海岸线，直接扫出 Voronoi 图，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且常数良好。它的巧妙在于把二维的邻近关系约化成一维海岸线上的局部更新。</p>\n<p>第三种是分治法：把点集按 x 坐标分成左右两半，各自递归求 Delaunay，再沿一条「缝合线」合并，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。此外还有前一节提到的抛物面提升法——把平面点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 抬到三维抛物面上的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y,x^2+y^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，求这些三维点的下凸包，再投影回平面，恰好得到 Delaunay 三角剖分，把 Delaunay 归约成三维凸包，见 <a href=\"convex-hull\">凸包算法</a>。三者复杂度相同，工程选择取决于是否需要增量更新与实现难度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从结构到应用\">从结构到应用</h2><p>这对结构是后面两章的重要接口。Voronoi 图直接解最近邻查询：点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的最近站点就是包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的 Voronoi 单元对应的站点，配合点定位结构可做到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查询，见 <a href=\"../queries/point-location\">点定位</a> 与 <a href=\"../practice/nearest-neighbor\">最近邻与空间索引</a>。Delaunay 三角网是有限元网格生成、地形三角网（TIN）、自然邻域插值的标准底层；在机器人路径规划里，Voronoi 图给出「离所有障碍物尽量远」的安全路径。它在数据科学里还与聚类相关，见 <a href=\"../../../data-science/cluster-analysis/clustering-foundations/what-is-clustering\">数据科学·聚类分析</a>（参见其聚类原理）。约束 Delaunay 三角剖分（允许强制包含某些边）则把它与前一节的多边形三角剖分连接起来，用于带边界约束的高质量网格，见 <a href=\"triangulation\">多边形三角剖分</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Voronoi 图按「最近站点」把平面划成凸单元，Delaunay 三角剖分连接相邻站点，二者互为对偶、携带相同信息。</li>\n<li>对偶关系：Delaunay 顶点↔Voronoi 单元、Delaunay 边↔Voronoi 边（垂直平分）、Delaunay 三角形↔Voronoi 顶点（外心）。</li>\n<li>Delaunay 由空圆性质刻画，它最大化最小角、避免瘦长三角形，是网格与插值的质量首选；判据是度数 4 的点在圆内谓词，对精度敏感。</li>\n<li>三种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 构造：增量翻边、Fortune 扫描线、分治；还可经三维抛物面提升归约为凸包。</li>\n<li>这对结构是最近邻、点定位、网格生成、路径规划的共同基石，连接查询与应用两章。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>空圆判据所需谓词与其精度成本：<a href=\"../foundations/geometric-primitives\">几何图元与谓词</a>、<a href=\"../foundations/robustness-degeneracy\">鲁棒性与退化</a>。</li>\n<li>用 Voronoi 单元定位最近站点：<a href=\"../queries/point-location\">点定位</a>、<a href=\"../practice/nearest-neighbor\">最近邻与空间索引</a>。</li>\n<li>提升法归约到的凸包：<a href=\"convex-hull\">凸包算法</a>。</li>\n<li>机器人里的路径规划应用：<a href=\"../../../robotics-automation/autonomous-navigation/motion-planning/path-planning-algorithms\">机器人·运动规划算法</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Delaunay 与 Voronoi：一枚硬币的两面","id":"delaunay-与-voronoi-一枚硬币的两面"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"对偶：为什么两者本质相同","id":"对偶-为什么两者本质相同"},{"level":2,"text":"空圆性质与 Delaunay 的优良品质","id":"空圆性质与-delaunay-的优良品质"},{"level":2,"text":"三种构造算法","id":"三种构造算法"},{"level":2,"text":"从结构到应用","id":"从结构到应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"多边形三角剖分：把复杂形状拆成三角形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/convex-triangulation/triangulation"},"next":{"title":"线段相交：扫描线登场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/queries/line-intersection"}}